WEBVTT

00:00:10.190 --> 00:00:12.270
What happened to that?

00:00:13.620 --> 00:00:15.500
I, um... hit the Earth for a home run.

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:16.380
Sorry!

00:00:16.380 --> 00:00:18.420
Just how strong <i>are</i> you?

00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:22.080
The rake also broke...

00:00:23.740 --> 00:00:25.950
There's a hole in the net.

00:00:25.950 --> 00:00:27.540
You're kidding!

00:00:27.540 --> 00:00:29.740
Everything about this place is run-down.

00:00:29.740 --> 00:00:31.930
Well, it is all old.

00:00:32.490 --> 00:00:33.850
What should we do?

00:00:34.980 --> 00:00:36.890
Well, we've used up our funds...

00:00:36.890 --> 00:00:39.220
I'll get a part-time job
to make up for it!

00:00:39.870 --> 00:00:41.770
If that's the plan,
why don't we all get jobs?

00:00:41.770 --> 00:00:43.170
All of us?

00:00:44.230 --> 00:00:45.440
Good idea.

00:00:45.440 --> 00:00:49.190
If it's only weekend casual work,
the school should allow it.

00:00:49.190 --> 00:00:50.810
All right! Let's do it!

00:00:50.810 --> 00:00:52.860
That may work in the short term,

00:00:52.860 --> 00:00:56.830
but do you expect us to work
every time we need money?

00:00:58.030 --> 00:01:00.060
W-Well...

00:01:00.660 --> 00:01:04.120
You need a lot of kit for baseball.
We'd be chasing our tails forever.

00:01:07.940 --> 00:01:09.540
We should get club status.

00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:14.170
We'd receive more funding if we did that.

00:01:15.070 --> 00:01:18.870
It's only been three months
since we started the association,

00:01:18.870 --> 00:01:22.150
but we've already come
a long way in such a short time.

00:01:22.150 --> 00:01:24.350
I think we should be able to apply for it now.

00:01:26.050 --> 00:01:27.560
A baseball club...

00:01:27.940 --> 00:01:29.230
Yeah, let's apply!

00:01:29.770 --> 00:01:32.270
Who should we see about applying?

00:01:32.270 --> 00:01:34.740
W-We should probably start with...

00:01:35.670 --> 00:01:38.070
And your advisor has
given their permission?

00:01:38.430 --> 00:01:39.230
Yes!

00:01:39.780 --> 00:01:41.310
Before you can be given club status,

00:01:39.780 --> 00:01:47.750
<b>Student Council Room</b>

00:01:41.310 --> 00:01:44.540
the student council must
evaluate your association

00:01:44.540 --> 00:01:47.750
and determine whether or not
its activities meet a certain standard.

00:01:47.750 --> 00:01:49.680
That's part of the process?

00:01:49.680 --> 00:01:51.390
It's the school's rule.

00:01:51.830 --> 00:01:53.710
I... I see.

00:01:55.130 --> 00:01:56.220
What's your decision?

00:01:56.670 --> 00:01:58.090
Bring it on!

00:01:59.390 --> 00:02:00.540
Very well.

00:02:01.410 --> 00:02:02.660
Tsukumo-san, if you would.

00:02:05.090 --> 00:02:08.540
I'm Tsukumo Kana.
I'm in charge of the athletic clubs.

00:02:09.110 --> 00:02:10.350
Nice to meet you.

00:02:10.350 --> 00:02:13.090
N-Nice to meet you, too...

00:02:13.820 --> 00:02:15.770
Here you go.

00:02:18.280 --> 00:02:20.360
Hero Tiger Chop!

00:02:20.360 --> 00:02:21.240
What?

00:02:21.240 --> 00:02:22.770
I'm Hero Tiger!

00:02:22.770 --> 00:02:25.120
Prepare to die, Baron Bunny!

00:02:25.120 --> 00:02:27.830
Um, I'm not a villain...

00:02:27.830 --> 00:02:31.890
Fortune-Favors-the-Hero Zoom Beam!

00:02:32.340 --> 00:02:33.970
What do I do?

00:02:33.970 --> 00:02:36.810
Hero Tiger, the captain wants to see you.

00:02:36.810 --> 00:02:38.340
What? Oh, okay!

00:02:38.340 --> 00:02:39.260
Huh?

00:02:41.230 --> 00:02:43.500
Th-Thanks for your help.

00:02:45.250 --> 00:02:46.470
Hey...

00:02:47.050 --> 00:02:48.340
Aren't you...

00:02:48.830 --> 00:02:49.690
What?

00:02:49.690 --> 00:02:51.070
Kurashiki-senpai?

00:02:51.070 --> 00:02:52.750
How do you know my name?

00:02:52.750 --> 00:02:55.380
Oh, I guess you don't
recognize me in this getup.

00:02:55.380 --> 00:02:56.440
Who are you?

00:02:56.440 --> 00:02:57.670
Hey! What—

00:02:56.440 --> 00:03:00.100
Have a balloon!

00:02:58.650 --> 00:03:01.410
Mama!

00:03:02.140 --> 00:03:06.840
It's me, Nozaki Yuuki. We went 
to the same elementary school.

00:03:06.840 --> 00:03:08.020
Nozaki?

00:03:09.710 --> 00:03:12.260
I had no idea that you also go to Sato High.

00:03:12.690 --> 00:03:15.610
I guess being in different years
will do that, huh?

00:03:15.610 --> 00:03:16.500
I guess so.

00:03:16.500 --> 00:03:18.390
But I'm glad I got to see you again.

00:03:18.390 --> 00:03:23.950
Remember how, whenever anyone was crying 
or in trouble, you'd rush to their aid?

00:03:23.950 --> 00:03:25.390
Like you did just now.

00:03:25.390 --> 00:03:27.450
That was when we were kids.

00:03:29.640 --> 00:03:34.310
Oh, right! Are you in any clubs at the moment?

00:03:35.110 --> 00:03:38.280
No, I'm not... Why?

00:03:38.280 --> 00:03:40.990
In that case, do you have 
any interest in baseball?

00:03:41.620 --> 00:03:42.310
Huh?

00:05:15.040 --> 00:05:18.960
<b>The Smiling Lost Child</b>

00:05:19.310 --> 00:05:22.580
An evaluation, huh? I'm so nervous...

00:05:22.580 --> 00:05:24.760
You're the one who said "bring it on."

00:05:25.220 --> 00:05:28.150
Well, I don't think she'll be too strict.

00:05:28.150 --> 00:05:31.140
Come to think of it, Nozaki-san's late...

00:05:31.140 --> 00:05:32.780
She said she was running behind.

00:05:32.780 --> 00:05:36.730
Hey! I brought us a new member!

00:05:36.730 --> 00:05:39.690
I'm only here to observe, Aoi.

00:05:41.110 --> 00:05:45.150
Asada-senpai, are you and 
Tsukumo-senpai good friends?

00:05:45.150 --> 00:05:46.900
We're in the same class.

00:05:46.900 --> 00:05:50.290
We're especially inseparable at exam time!

00:05:50.290 --> 00:05:52.650
Tsukumo has the highest grades in our year,

00:05:52.650 --> 00:05:56.120
and she's been in the student council
since her first year!

00:05:56.120 --> 00:05:57.330
What's more...

00:06:00.270 --> 00:06:02.170
Picture purrfect.

00:06:02.170 --> 00:06:04.030
She's super athletic, too!

00:06:04.030 --> 00:06:06.050
She doesn't even need my encouragement!

00:06:06.050 --> 00:06:07.650
So she's an all-rounder.

00:06:08.540 --> 00:06:11.720
If she joined our team, 
she'd be a real asset.

00:06:11.720 --> 00:06:13.250
That's not possible.

00:06:13.810 --> 00:06:14.530
Wh-What?

00:06:14.530 --> 00:06:17.870
I'm only here to evaluate you. Nothing more.

00:06:17.870 --> 00:06:19.770
Oh... Sorry.

00:06:21.170 --> 00:06:23.460
See? You did it again.

00:06:23.460 --> 00:06:26.640
I'm sorry. I don't mean to sound hostile.

00:06:26.640 --> 00:06:29.370
Tsukumo's a pretty awkward girl.

00:06:29.370 --> 00:06:30.820
Awkward?

00:06:30.820 --> 00:06:34.280
Sorry I'm late!

00:06:35.990 --> 00:06:38.060
Why is a student council member here?

00:06:38.060 --> 00:06:40.530
She's evaluating us
because we want club status.

00:06:43.020 --> 00:06:45.490
This is Kurashiki Maiko-senpai, a second-year.

00:06:45.490 --> 00:06:48.070
Oh, yeah! You're in the class
next-door to mine!

00:06:48.070 --> 00:06:53.580
She's very athletic. She was 
one of the best at dodgeball.

00:06:53.580 --> 00:06:57.810
Really? In that case,
you might make a good pitcher.

00:06:57.810 --> 00:06:59.910
I really don't care about any of that.

00:06:59.910 --> 00:07:01.920
I'm only here because I was bored.

00:07:01.920 --> 00:07:05.250
Oh, come on! You came
because you were interested!

00:07:08.790 --> 00:07:11.950
Okay, we'll say you're a trial member for now.

00:07:21.690 --> 00:07:23.470
One more, please!

00:07:24.590 --> 00:07:27.730
She actually hit the
strike zone on her first try.

00:07:27.730 --> 00:07:30.410
Most first-timers don't get anywhere close.

00:07:30.410 --> 00:07:32.300
She's a really promising rookie!

00:07:39.810 --> 00:07:41.620
I've changed my mind. Count me out.

00:07:42.370 --> 00:07:43.520
Why?

00:07:43.520 --> 00:07:47.120
You're still being evaluated to get
official club status, aren't you?

00:07:47.120 --> 00:07:49.220
I don't want to deal
with that kind of hassle.

00:07:49.220 --> 00:07:50.970
Please don't leave.

00:07:50.970 --> 00:07:53.150
We all want to get better.

00:07:53.150 --> 00:07:56.620
If you stay with us,
I think we'll be able to.

00:07:56.620 --> 00:07:59.780
Won't you give it just a little bit longer?

00:07:59.780 --> 00:08:03.750
If you insist on leaving,
it'll be over my dead body!

00:08:03.750 --> 00:08:06.930
Come on, then! Leave, if you dare!

00:08:06.930 --> 00:08:08.500
Bring it!

00:08:07.330 --> 00:08:11.160
It's not like I have anything
else to do after school.

00:08:11.160 --> 00:08:13.180
If I can stay on as a trial member...

00:08:13.180 --> 00:08:14.340
Senpai!

00:08:14.340 --> 00:08:15.160
All right!

00:08:15.160 --> 00:08:16.510
Great!

00:08:19.060 --> 00:08:20.430
Kurashiki-san, the second-year...

00:08:21.070 --> 00:08:23.230
Seems she's had several
run-ins with the police.

00:08:23.230 --> 00:08:25.530
Yes. All of them were over the last year.

00:08:25.530 --> 00:08:28.050
Each time, she was out 
walking late at night,

00:08:28.830 --> 00:08:31.570
but when asked why she was out there,
she never gave an answer.

00:08:31.990 --> 00:08:34.820
That is certainly cause for concern,

00:08:34.820 --> 00:08:37.700
but what's your opinion 
after meeting her yourself?

00:08:38.170 --> 00:08:40.530
At present, I'm unable 
to make any judgments.

00:08:41.050 --> 00:08:42.160
But...

00:08:43.750 --> 00:08:45.830
She is rather antisocial,

00:08:45.830 --> 00:08:49.510
so communicating with her teammates
may be a struggle.

00:08:54.870 --> 00:08:57.180
Are you really in a position to say that?

00:09:03.850 --> 00:09:05.890
Try holding it like this when you throw.

00:09:31.370 --> 00:09:33.350
You should practice with this!

00:09:33.980 --> 00:09:35.670
What... is that?

00:09:35.670 --> 00:09:37.630
A ball, of course!

00:10:01.650 --> 00:10:03.120
Be careful.

00:10:03.120 --> 00:10:04.570
Thanks...

00:10:08.870 --> 00:10:10.300
Kurashiki-senpai!

00:10:11.690 --> 00:10:14.250
It looks like you're settling in just fine.

00:10:14.250 --> 00:10:16.790
You've improved much faster than I expected.

00:10:16.790 --> 00:10:19.730
You have superior physical strength,
and natural talent, too.

00:10:19.730 --> 00:10:22.770
That's right! She's amazing!

00:10:22.770 --> 00:10:24.420
Come on, cut it out.

00:10:24.420 --> 00:10:26.620
In elementary school, she was just...

00:10:26.620 --> 00:10:27.620
Stop.

00:10:27.620 --> 00:10:30.110
Aw, am I embarrassing you, Senpai?

00:10:31.350 --> 00:10:33.400
Don't try and hide it!

00:10:37.270 --> 00:10:38.820
What?

00:10:39.260 --> 00:10:41.530
You look like you're having fun.

00:10:41.530 --> 00:10:42.340
Huh?

00:10:42.990 --> 00:10:45.890
If you've got something to say, spit it out!

00:10:45.890 --> 00:10:47.050
I just did.

00:10:47.050 --> 00:10:48.660
You saying you don't like me?

00:10:48.660 --> 00:10:50.580
Wait, Senpai!

00:10:50.580 --> 00:10:53.540
Her facial muscles are
in dire need of a workout.

00:10:53.540 --> 00:10:55.000
What did you mean by that?

00:10:55.400 --> 00:10:58.090
I apologize if what I said offended you.

00:10:59.900 --> 00:11:00.800
Senpai!

00:11:05.260 --> 00:11:06.850
Okay, bring it!

00:11:12.570 --> 00:11:13.870
Nice pitch!

00:11:16.710 --> 00:11:19.650
That was a great pitch, Maiko!

00:11:20.360 --> 00:11:22.600
Nice pitch!

00:11:20.980 --> 00:11:23.070
Way to go!

00:11:22.600 --> 00:11:24.380
Kurashiki-senpai!

00:11:38.380 --> 00:11:39.380
Tsukumo-san!

00:11:39.380 --> 00:11:40.810
I'm glad I caught you!

00:11:40.810 --> 00:11:42.930
What did you think of
the baseball association?

00:11:42.930 --> 00:11:45.540
I think they are taking it very seriously.

00:11:45.540 --> 00:11:49.180
Really? I hope you have fun playing, too.

00:11:52.290 --> 00:11:53.980
You still amaze me, Senpai.

00:11:53.980 --> 00:11:57.800
It's only been a week, and even 
Waka-san has showered you with praise!

00:11:57.800 --> 00:11:59.110
Yeah, yeah.

00:12:02.430 --> 00:12:03.530
What?

00:12:03.530 --> 00:12:06.420
I'm just happy to see you having fun.

00:12:06.910 --> 00:12:10.990
When I first ran into you, you seemed 
different from when we were little.

00:12:10.990 --> 00:12:12.000
Did I?

00:12:13.070 --> 00:12:14.460
Well, see you tomorrow.

00:12:14.460 --> 00:12:15.810
Goodbye.

00:12:20.630 --> 00:12:21.920
Senpai!

00:12:24.180 --> 00:12:25.930
See you tomorrow!

00:13:03.420 --> 00:13:06.840
Your father said he won't 
be home again tonight.

00:13:06.840 --> 00:13:08.890
And after I made dinner for all of us...

00:13:09.780 --> 00:13:12.350
When did it all fall apart?

00:13:13.340 --> 00:13:15.900
He never used to be like this...

00:13:16.810 --> 00:13:20.530
Maiko... I'm so tired of it.

00:13:21.590 --> 00:13:24.740
You hate having a father 
like him, don't you?

00:13:25.470 --> 00:13:28.100
Don't you, Maiko?

00:13:29.140 --> 00:13:30.370
You do, don't you?

00:13:30.370 --> 00:13:31.610
Don't you?

00:13:50.640 --> 00:13:50.760
Arihara

00:13:50.760 --> 00:13:50.890
Arihara

00:13:50.890 --> 00:13:51.010
Arihara

00:13:51.010 --> 00:13:52.970
Arihara

00:13:51.900 --> 00:13:54.690
Nakano-san didn't come here with you?

00:13:54.690 --> 00:13:57.460
The teacher asked to
see her for some reason.

00:13:57.460 --> 00:13:59.440
Kurashiki-senpai isn't here, either.

00:14:02.740 --> 00:14:04.420
Bad news!

00:14:04.420 --> 00:14:05.860
It's Kurashiki-paisen!

00:14:05.860 --> 00:14:08.350
Senpai? What happened to her?

00:14:08.830 --> 00:14:11.230
I happened to overhear
in the staff office...

00:14:11.230 --> 00:14:14.290
They said the police
picked her up last night!

00:14:14.290 --> 00:14:15.470
What?

00:14:16.630 --> 00:14:18.470
It has to be some kind of mistake!

00:14:18.470 --> 00:14:21.880
But they just said her mother
has come into school for a "chat"...

00:14:21.880 --> 00:14:24.340
It must be something serious.

00:14:24.780 --> 00:14:25.950
Oh, no...

00:14:26.840 --> 00:14:32.430
(Temp) Kurashiki

00:14:26.850 --> 00:14:28.760
It has to be a misunderstanding!

00:14:28.760 --> 00:14:31.550
I agree. Kurashiki-senpai isn't
the type to get into trouble.

00:14:32.430 --> 00:14:35.220
Tsukumo, have you heard anything?

00:14:35.980 --> 00:14:38.510
No, nothing.

00:14:49.230 --> 00:14:51.280
Where is Senpai?

00:14:51.280 --> 00:14:54.030
Kakehashi-sensei might know something.

00:14:54.030 --> 00:14:55.260
The kendo club!

00:14:57.210 --> 00:14:59.210
I'll go to the staff office.

00:14:59.210 --> 00:15:00.890
I'll go with you!

00:15:00.890 --> 00:15:02.710
Let's all split up and look for her.

00:15:02.710 --> 00:15:03.160
Okay!

00:15:03.160 --> 00:15:03.450
Right!

00:15:03.450 --> 00:15:04.000
Yeah!

00:15:07.590 --> 00:15:09.590
<b>Student Council Room</b>

00:15:10.130 --> 00:15:14.080
Even if the other party was drunk,
you're also partially to blame.

00:15:14.080 --> 00:15:15.330
Why did you fight?

00:15:16.230 --> 00:15:18.560
Could you tell us your reasons?

00:15:22.020 --> 00:15:23.470
Kurashiki-san...

00:15:33.160 --> 00:15:36.120
<b>Student Council Room</b>

00:15:36.120 --> 00:15:40.810
If this keeps happening, the school
will have to discipline you somehow.

00:15:44.630 --> 00:15:46.390
I'm so sorry!

00:15:46.860 --> 00:15:50.340
It's my fault she's turned out like this.

00:15:52.730 --> 00:15:57.700
You see... things haven't been 
good at home for some time.

00:15:58.180 --> 00:16:02.430
I've been thinking about moving us
away for a change of scenery.

00:16:02.430 --> 00:16:04.900
M-Ma'am, that's...

00:16:05.370 --> 00:16:08.680
It would mean transferring
her to a new school,

00:16:08.680 --> 00:16:11.190
but I think it would be best for her...

00:16:12.590 --> 00:16:15.160
Besides, my husband is...

00:16:18.110 --> 00:16:21.630
I can't take it anymore... Surely, you two—

00:16:21.630 --> 00:16:23.730
Please, calm down.

00:16:23.730 --> 00:16:25.950
You understand, don't you?

00:16:25.950 --> 00:16:27.410
Well, that's, um...

00:16:29.150 --> 00:16:31.920
We should hear Maiko-san's side first.

00:16:34.580 --> 00:16:36.500
Don't speak for me.

00:16:36.500 --> 00:16:37.890
Maiko!

00:16:37.890 --> 00:16:40.310
You dare talk about what's best for me?

00:16:41.020 --> 00:16:43.710
This is all just to suit the two of you...

00:16:43.710 --> 00:16:46.170
To suit you and Dad...

00:16:46.860 --> 00:16:50.320
How long do I have to
keep putting up with this?

00:16:50.320 --> 00:16:54.290
How do you think I feel, 
being caught in the middle?!

00:16:54.770 --> 00:16:57.240
I'm sick of it!

00:16:57.240 --> 00:17:00.350
Don't... Don't...

00:17:01.390 --> 00:17:03.200
Don't take my place away from me!

00:17:07.010 --> 00:17:08.010
Kurashiki!

00:17:11.210 --> 00:17:16.180
So, um... Did you hear that Maiko-san 
has started playing baseball?

00:17:16.180 --> 00:17:17.300
Huh?

00:17:17.850 --> 00:17:20.760
She's very good at looking out for others.

00:17:20.760 --> 00:17:23.910
The first-years all look up to her.

00:17:25.510 --> 00:17:33.110
And above all, Maiko-san seems to really
enjoy playing baseball with the other girls.

00:17:53.920 --> 00:17:55.170
Tsukumo!

00:17:55.170 --> 00:17:57.100
Where are you going?!

00:17:55.170 --> 00:17:58.130
No running

00:17:55.170 --> 00:17:58.130
in the hall

00:17:55.170 --> 00:17:58.130
Student Council

00:18:08.730 --> 00:18:09.970
I've been looking for you.

00:18:12.060 --> 00:18:13.060
How did you...

00:18:13.590 --> 00:18:15.590
I've seen you up here before.

00:18:17.450 --> 00:18:18.730
Go away.

00:18:19.230 --> 00:18:20.550
I can't do that.

00:18:21.890 --> 00:18:23.830
Then I will.

00:18:26.390 --> 00:18:28.410
You should tell them the truth.

00:18:30.960 --> 00:18:33.180
Did you tell them you'd bring me back?

00:18:33.180 --> 00:18:34.010
No.

00:18:34.010 --> 00:18:35.020
Liar.

00:18:35.020 --> 00:18:36.170
I'm not lying.

00:18:39.860 --> 00:18:42.010
You don't want to set
them straight on all this?

00:18:42.010 --> 00:18:44.850
Don't talk like you know anything!

00:18:44.850 --> 00:18:47.770
I do know. I've been watching you.

00:18:50.020 --> 00:18:53.400
You should stay in the association.

00:18:54.910 --> 00:18:58.900
Why... would you say that?!

00:18:59.670 --> 00:19:02.460
I'm not good at expressing my feelings.

00:19:03.330 --> 00:19:05.210
I never have been.

00:19:06.260 --> 00:19:09.210
At first, I thought you were the same,

00:19:09.690 --> 00:19:11.180
but you're not.

00:19:12.470 --> 00:19:16.170
When you're with the other girls,
you look happy.

00:19:18.970 --> 00:19:20.750
I thought it was really nice.

00:19:21.260 --> 00:19:22.740
So what?

00:19:22.740 --> 00:19:23.820
So...

00:19:26.300 --> 00:19:29.210
I... want you...

00:19:33.370 --> 00:19:35.190
to smile more.

00:19:38.790 --> 00:19:40.450
What do you really want to do?

00:19:41.340 --> 00:19:43.620
Tell me how you feel.

00:19:45.890 --> 00:19:50.330
I thought no one had ever really looked at me.

00:19:50.950 --> 00:19:53.630
Why did it have to be you, of all people?

00:19:54.620 --> 00:19:57.590
I apologize if what I said offended you.

00:20:00.330 --> 00:20:03.950
All right. You want me to talk to them?

00:20:16.480 --> 00:20:21.190
<b>Student Council Room</b>

00:20:17.190 --> 00:20:20.660
Kurashiki-san only had to 
submit a written apology.

00:20:21.210 --> 00:20:22.590
That's not surprising.

00:20:22.590 --> 00:20:26.600
She only got caught up
in a fight between some drunkards.

00:20:26.600 --> 00:20:27.580
Yes.

00:20:28.150 --> 00:20:31.500
It seems her parents are going 
to talk things over, too.

00:20:32.290 --> 00:20:37.000
It's a complicated matter,
but she'll be able to stay at this school.

00:20:37.000 --> 00:20:38.170
I see.

00:20:41.150 --> 00:20:46.430
Anyway... I never imagined 
you'd give a speech like that.

00:20:47.730 --> 00:20:52.560
What Kurashiki-san needs right now 
is a place where she can be herself.

00:20:53.190 --> 00:20:57.020
I believe the girls' baseball 
association can be that place.

00:20:58.370 --> 00:20:59.510
Please consider it.

00:21:03.540 --> 00:21:06.650
I was just doing my duty as
a member of the student council.

00:21:06.650 --> 00:21:07.570
Really?

00:21:08.450 --> 00:21:10.410
And what did Kurashiki-san say?

00:21:10.410 --> 00:21:12.030
She's joining the association.

00:21:13.370 --> 00:21:17.380
<b>Girls' Baseball Association!</b>

00:21:13.370 --> 00:21:17.380
Remember to knock!

00:21:23.300 --> 00:21:29.730
Also... I'd like to continue observing 
the association for a while longer.

00:21:31.030 --> 00:21:33.220
But they already passed their evaluation.

00:21:33.220 --> 00:21:34.920
Could I?

00:21:34.920 --> 00:21:36.780
I don't mind, of course.

00:21:38.270 --> 00:21:39.610
Thank you.

00:21:42.350 --> 00:21:43.810
What's the matter?

00:21:47.910 --> 00:21:50.160
Oh, nothing.

00:21:50.610 --> 00:21:54.620
As for the table tennis club's 
request for gym space...

00:21:54.620 --> 00:21:55.330
Membership Application

00:21:55.330 --> 00:21:55.580
Membership Application

00:21:55.580 --> 00:21:56.080
Membership Application

00:21:57.730 --> 00:21:59.370
Glad to have you!

00:22:08.010 --> 00:22:14.970
(Temp) Kurashiki

00:22:08.010 --> 00:22:14.970
X

00:22:15.020 --> 00:22:20.020
<b>Next Time</b>

00:22:15.020 --> 00:22:20.020
<b>Looking Ahead to Summer</b>
